    "updated_at": "2018-02-05T21:48:40Z",
    "body": "Wouldn't  #1246 just give you what the spec supports and not what browsers support? I don't see how it wouldn't have normative impact if it is used for code generation like Edge currently does. It would normatively define which interface an element implements. ",
