    "created_at": "2018-02-05T22:26:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-05T22:26:52Z",
    "body": "Sure, I wasn't arguing against  #1246, just that it didn't fully cover the use case I proposed this for. \r\n\r\nThe hope was to get a common way to define the mapping that all browsers use. WebIDL seemed logical as we already used WebIDL and it kept all the information in one place. ",
