    "created_at": "2018-02-06T17:12:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-06T17:12:13Z",
    "body": "Which of the use cases in the OP does #1246 not cover?\r\n\r\nIn general I don't see Web IDL as logical for defining things that _use_ an interface; instead it should be for defining the interface. (For example, at least in Blink, we keep those separate in our codebase.)",
