    "created_at": "2018-02-16T15:40:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-16T15:40:36Z",
    "body": "It seems this could also be used to formalize step 5.1 of `HTMLConstructor` (it's rather vague at the moment and it's not clear if it's the inverse of the definition @domenic pointed at above).\r\n\r\nI agree that not everything that can be expressed in IDL should be, and also that non-normative material has no real place there, but when it can be used for normative purposes and ends up adding clarity I'm somewhat easily swayed.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
